 ],
 "exclude_notes": {
  "^ast$": "OpenTitan analog sensor top (vendored): an always_ff resets vcc_pok_str_no_scan_h to a NON-CONSTANT under vcc_pok_rst_h_n; yosys proc_arst rejects it (`Async reset ... yields non-constant value 4'mmm0`) -- a behavioural analog model, not synthesizable RTL",
